## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/menu.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as Menu from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/menu";
</script>

<Menu.Root>
  <Menu.Trigger>Open menu</Menu.Trigger>
  <Menu.Popup>
    <Menu.Item>Profile</Menu.Item>
    <Menu.Item>Settings</Menu.Item>
  </Menu.Popup>
</Menu.Root>
```

## API Reference

### Menu.Root

Manages a popup menu and its trigger.

### Menu.Trigger

Opens the menu.

### Menu.Popup

Contains menu items.

### Menu.Group

Groups related items.

### Menu.Item

An individual action.

### Menu.LinkItem

A native anchor styled as a menu item.

### Menu.CheckboxItem

A checkable menu item, with an optional switch appearance.

### Menu.RadioGroup

Groups radio menu items.

### Menu.RadioItem

A radio menu item.

### Menu.GroupLabel

Labels a menu group.

### Menu.Separator

Separates menu sections.

### Menu.Shortcut

Displays keyboard shortcut text.

### Menu.Sub

Manages a submenu.

### Menu.SubTrigger

Opens a submenu.

### Menu.SubPopup

Contains submenu items.

